ied with direct final-state and behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete on both nodes: healthy pre-restart states, acknowledgements, changed boot identities, and recovered service/data/access behavior are shown, with fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agreeing. Only minor cleanup and package-verification concerns remain.","limitations":["Native package-health checks timed out before preparation, after preparation, and after execution on both nodes, so RPM dependency consistency was not independently confirmed despite successful installs and runtime behavior.","The final evidence did not re-audit repository configuration; earlier commands show the CentOS 7 vault repository enabled, with no later removal or disablement captured."]}
